                "message": "Flag crossref chains deeper than two levels and skip them\n\nA crossref whose parent has a crossref too (a loop or self-reference\nincluded) is flagged in the dry run and by a message; bib-parent and the\nparent note are left alone for it.  This replaces the loop and depth guards.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiD5W4k4UTcudsexBjX",
